  (text "UV-Sight carrier board for the XIAO nRF52840 Sense" (at 30.48 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c83d84b5-1780-5979-9430-7404b46e53fc))
  (text "UV LED driver: LED in the sight, 2-core wire to J3.\nLED runs from the battery (3.4-4.2 V), D6 PWM switches Q1.\nBC547 pinout (flat side facing you, legs down): C - B - E" (at 147.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid abd343d2-c528-5326-9e68-5711c0f30ffe))
  (text "Light sensor: D2 powers the LDR only during a measurement.\nLDR head sits in the hole in the housing floor." (at 208.28 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 987a0818-987b-5d7e-95b6-081edace1a0e))
  (text "Battery: LiPo 3.7 V 85 mAh with protection circuit.\nNTC wire: not connected, insulate.\nU1 pin 15 = short wire from the VBAT pad\non the underside of the XIAO through the board." (at 15.24 177.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ce771583-35ce-502a-bf64-62beb7cd46a2))
  (text "J2: display / expansion (unused XIAO pins)\n1 3V3   2 GND\n3 D7    4 D8 (SCK)\n5 D9 (MISO)  6 D10 (MOSI)\n7 5V    8 GND" (at 137.16 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1749838e-98b5-5e82-bfb1-820dbe2a5d79))
  (text "D1, D3, D4/SDA, D5/SCL stay free (reachable on the XIAO header pins)." (at 30.48 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b8718b4e-0b3a-553f-93a0-61ddc8a70883))
